---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About — Anatomy of Becoming"
  description="The story behind Anatomy of Becoming. A healing space for thoughts never said out loud."
>
  <section class="container-soft py-section max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-display text-espresso mb-6 text-center text-balance">
      About <span class="handwriting text-6xl md:text-7xl block mt-2">Anatomy of Becoming</span>
    </h1>
    
    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="prose-soft">
      <p>
        <strong>Anatomy of Becoming</strong> is not just a blog. It is a digital diary, a memoir in progress, 
        and a safe emotional archive for the thoughts I never said out loud.
      </p>

      <p>
        This space exists for the quiet confessions. The unsent thoughts. The grief you carry silently. 
        The healing that happens in slow motion. The rebuilding that no one sees.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        <p>
          Some versions of us survive things the current version no longer has to.
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Here, we explore identity, womanhood, medicine, faith, toxic love, childhood wounds, 
        loneliness, ambition, and the long, nonlinear process of becoming ourselves.
      </p>

      <p>
        Whether you're healing from loss, leaving something behind, starting over, 
        or simply trying to understand yourself — you are welcome here.
      </p>

      <p class="handwriting text-3xl text-center mt-8">
        Write to understand yourself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>